{"id":"n88095-1-7","stage":2,"title":"후식 · 餐后甜点","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88095-1-7-1","ko":"식사를 마치셨으면 후식을 드릴까요?","zh":"您用完餐了吗？要上餐后饮品或甜点吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식사를","meaning":"用餐，就餐，餐","explanation":"식사：用餐，就餐，餐；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"식사","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29596","senseId":"1","lemma":"식사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식사를","audio":"/audio/951a7dab5ca906e7426c.mp3"}},{"text":"마치셨으면","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"마치다：结束，完成；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"마치다","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61135","senseId":"1","lemma":"마치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마치셨으면","audio":"/audio/86f7bf076f8a1081fca4.mp3"}},{"text":"후식을","meaning":"餐后甜点，饭后甜点","explanation":"후식：餐后甜点，饭后甜点；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"후식","audio":"/audio/23f61319f9dba7324c6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88095","senseId":"1","lemma":"후식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후식을","audio":"/audio/26a432732a46b15d2ce5.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴까요?","meaning":"给、奉上（주다 的谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：给、奉上（주다 的谦敬表达）；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴까요","audio":"/audio/235c96fe68d709255264.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0f82e313dadba4d8","term":"식사","zh":"用餐，就餐，餐","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3","entryId":"29596","definition":"像早餐、午餐、晚餐那样每天在固定时间吃饭；或指那时吃的食物。","pronunciation":["식싸"]},{"id":"48af85297dcba6b9","term":"마치다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3","entryId":"61135","definition":"做的事或过程完结；或指使其完结。","pronunciation":["마치다"]},{"id":"23f61319f9dba732","term":"후식","zh":"餐后甜点，饭后